{"id": "q14", "question": "Fill the blank with one word: Cloud Court Etiquette: A guest who says \"Your Vaporous Majesty\" must make clear whether the title is meant for the king or the queen. A discreet gesture shows which royal the guest is ____ to."}
{"id": "q15", "question": "Fill the blank with one word: Under the dragon kingdom's tax code, every hoard must be registered with the official who sits behind the counter at the entrance to the treasury. Submit the inventory to the clerk at the tax ____."}
